* File:        starrc.cmd.in
* Author:      Isaac Hagedorn
* Date:        2026-10-09
* Description: StarRC command file template (LEF/DEF in, SPEF out). run_starrc.sh fills in the @NAME@ fields.

* Design: the routed DEF from IC Compiler II and the LEF of the cells
BLOCK: @TOP@
TOP_DEF_FILE: @DEF@
LEF_FILE: @LEFS@

* Process: RC tables from the ITF, and the LEF-to-ITF layer names
TCAD_GRD_FILE: @NXTGRD@
MAPPING_FILE: @MAP@

* Extract R and C of every signal net; cells are black boxes
EXTRACTION: RC
SKIP_CELLS: *
* Coupling capacitance goes to ground (no crosstalk analysis)
COUPLE_TO_GROUND: YES
REDUCTION: NO_EXTRA_LOOPS

* Output
NETLIST_FORMAT: SPEF
NETLIST_FILE: @SPEF@
SUMMARY_FILE: @SUMMARY@
STAR_DIRECTORY: @STAR_DIR@
NUM_CORES: @CORES@
